conformance	report,fields-min=100	the conformance harness ships as a module a driver author runs, so its surface IS read from outside; 208 of 208 fields carry a comment since C20, so the floor is 100 like every published module's. It was 58 -- the figure C03 measured over the 58 fields this module then had -- and it stopped being a ratchet as the module grew to 208: 61 comments could have gone before it fired (see hack/FOLLOWUPS.md, CLOSED by C20)

example	direct typed opening	.:Example,memory:Example,memory:Example_dsn	the driver's own Open with a typed Config, which is §5.2's first form, beside the DSN form it is preferred over
example	memory testing	memory:Example_testing	a broker whose clock only moves when the test says so (§8.9); memory.NewForTest is the same thing plus the cleanup and the leak check
example	sync/async/batch/owned publication	.:ExamplePublisherHandle_Publish,.:ExamplePublisherHandle_PublishAsync,.:ExamplePublisherHandle_PublishBatch,.:ExamplePublisherHandle_PublishOwned	§13 names the four shapes as one item and each has its own example
example	manual receive	.:ExampleConsumerHandle_Receive	Row B9's caller-owned slice, and who settles
example	iterator	.:ExampleHeaders_All	Headers.All is the range-over-func surface; ListTopics is Admin's and needs a broker
example	runner	.:Example	ConsumerHandle.Run with concurrency and key ordering
example	batch handler	.:ExampleConsumerHandle_RunBatch	the three answers a BatchHandler can give, and why there is no batch-size option
example	ordering	.:ExampleWithOrdering	the scope and the retry interaction, which are two options and not one (assumption A30.2)
example	dlq	.:ExampleConsumerHandle_Run_deadLetter	§4.5's failure policy, the five attempts and the provenance headers
example	graceful shutdown	.:ExampleClient_Shutdown	§4.11's two verbs and why calling Close after Shutdown is the normal shape
example	settle	.:ExampleDelivery_Nack	the terminal answers, and §8.5's exactly-one-settlement rule
example	headers	.:ExampleHeaders	row B4's ordered, duplicate-preserving set: Get is the first value, Values is all of them
example	middleware	middleware:Example,middleware:ExampleFilter,middleware:ExampleID	§5.10's two directions, composed once with mq.Chain
example	typed codec	typed:Example,typed:ExampleNewHandler	§5.11's generic layer and its decode-failure policy
example	reqreply	reqreply:Example	§5.12's one reply consumer per client, and why emulation is opt-in
example	native escape hatch	.:ExampleClient_Native,.:ExampleClient_Info	the hatch, and the portable surface a program should reach for first
example	every driver's open	perdriver	one Example per package that exports Open: seventeen driver packages plus memory
